  "body": "Positioned in the heart of Takapuna, 20 Bracken Avenue offers an exceptional combination of space, lifestyle and location.\r\n\r\nDesigned for relaxed family living and effortless entertaining, generous living spaces connect seamlessly to the outdoor area, decks and swimming pool, creating the perfect setting for long summer days with family and friends. This home comprises four bedrooms, two bathrooms and two living spaces. The second lounge could be utilised as a fifth bedroom. \r\n\r\nRenovated by the current vendor circa 2012 the home offers double glazed joinery, a mechanical ventilation system, and two heat pumps.\r\n\r\nWith ample off-street car parking and a garage, there's plenty of room for multiple vehicles to park and turn around, a rare advantage in such a central Takapuna location.\r\n\r\nJust moments from Takapuna Beach, vibrant cafés, restaurants, shops and excellent schools, this is a home that delivers the space families want with everything Takapuna has to offer right on the doorstep.",
